=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcc63e619320bc128e7f8a9f46bf505a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの画風と表情の細やかな描写が大好きなので、私のOCであるネズミの女の子を描いていただきたいと思います。\n夜空の下で星を抱いて泣いている女の子の胸像をお願いしたいです！よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-0tGYncXcGS_ZzpsT56eXJsfY1twQiB2", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8osakana_san8/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9b0216ac/uploads/origins/0f704d41-3bd0-4e32-8383-74c8374e476c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9797418036d8dcf1da36e39dfc1700b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9b0216ac/uploads/origins/0f704d41-3bd0-4e32-8383-74c8374e476c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9797418036d8dcf1da36e39dfc1700b, https://si.imgix.net/9b0216ac/uploads/origins/0f704d41-3bd0-4e32-8383-74c8374e476c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d3fe975fd6d5e48fb09aadda6b553d0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9b0216ac/uploads/origins/0f704d41-3bd0-4e32-8383-74c8374e476c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78283b4f077578398d6bf56fbe82507f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のOCはミミという名前のネズミの女の子で、身長が低い郵便配達人です。彼女を好きなように描いてほしい！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wMXKG1sRrkr3hvp-iFNXNKcbhGDj3pBr?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8osakana_san8/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a9165404/uploads/origins/037c0abf-8566-48ae-b750-eedc551fcdca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ec27730aac951237e66cd27d8a00829", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a9165404/uploads/origins/037c0abf-8566-48ae-b750-eedc551fcdca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ec27730aac951237e66cd27d8a00829, https://si.imgix.net/a9165404/uploads/origins/037c0abf-8566-48ae-b750-eedc551fcdca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cac2f9ed72128bcde4775d667a5b28f1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a9165404/uploads/origins/037c0abf-8566-48ae-b750-eedc551fcdca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47932d622b03524daf3ad914b8b76074 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please draw calaums. niko and alula are having a pajama party (they are having a pillow fight).", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8osakana_san8/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/81fbf6f5/uploads/origins/b42ac7a0-387a-4b35-b6aa-2233c1e1c35a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=105ef7c1074379773fe1730ddf9d7a7d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/81fbf6f5/uploads/origins/b42ac7a0-387a-4b35-b6aa-2233c1e1c35a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=105ef7c1074379773fe1730ddf9d7a7d, https://si.imgix.net/81fbf6f5/uploads/origins/b42ac7a0-387a-4b35-b6aa-2233c1e1c35a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a57291bbe5ec56f2eac58ca0e88ed97 2x, https://si.imgix.net/81fbf6f5/uploads/origins/b42ac7a0-387a-4b35-b6aa-2233c1e1c35a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8995378b19e4b7f581739c89f8a0f97 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'd like to invite you to paint two illustrations. The first illustration is about oneshot's maize, in which a green light enters her cave and shines on a blue rose. And maize sits behind it holding the base of a leaf in his hand. The second painting shows calamus brushing alula's hair. And I don't know what you charge, so please mention the price.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8osakana_san8/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/03fa1342/uploads/origins/df8794d5-676b-4b37-8a80-e16d3da17a7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ffc77746af42ce5a79b8d98a4f15916", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03fa1342/uploads/origins/df8794d5-676b-4b37-8a80-e16d3da17a7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ffc77746af42ce5a79b8d98a4f15916, https://si.imgix.net/03fa1342/uploads/origins/df8794d5-676b-4b37-8a80-e16d3da17a7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f3a20b917d0ae7b4a6254f1622c9cd6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/03fa1342/uploads/origins/df8794d5-676b-4b37-8a80-e16d3da17a7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2321098d404c0afa2c98c120353c306 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\n\nもしよろしければ\nhttps://www.foriio.com/works/526203\nhttps://www.foriio.com/works/581929\nどちらか好きな方、または両方を描いてほしいです。\n\n構図･シチュエーション･衣装のデザイン、アレンジ等全てお任せします。\n\n使用用途：壁紙やネットプリント等個人使用･misskeyでの紹介\n衣装をデザインして頂いた場合自分で描かせて頂くことがあります。\n\nサイン･背景等レイヤー分けされたPSDファイルを希望しますが、その他ファイル形式でも大丈夫です。\nご検討よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://fori.io/yokutototo-h", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8osakana_san8/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3973703/uploads/origins/c1456951-4ddd-4f46-afba-3b95c04328ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab504c6093c540fc2014ffe124a57a7a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c3973703/uploads/origins/c1456951-4ddd-4f46-afba-3b95c04328ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab504c6093c540fc2014ffe124a57a7a, https://si.imgix.net/c3973703/uploads/origins/c1456951-4ddd-4f46-afba-3b95c04328ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f93807c67f6ba50faf4373385b4100d4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c3973703/uploads/origins/c1456951-4ddd-4f46-afba-3b95c04328ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=092d2217638960f55f22f5831e1f0448 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして、島ねねこといいます。\nOneShotの、7th Anniversaryアニメーションから参りました！\nもし良ければ、私もOneShot風なイラストをおさかなさんに描いていただきたく、ご依頼させていただければと思います。\nどうぞ、よろしくお願いいたします！\nX(旧Twitter)、Twitchのアイコン画像をよければ参考にお願いします。\n参考ポスト▷資料URLより\n\nhttps://x.com/shiman3neko/status/1768328228924723212?s=46&t=Yu67q05pys3hsQkeeXXAWg", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8osakana_san8/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b867a98/uploads/origins/ca1e9c1d-1f21-4b2f-93b7-e043cb98bd5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e997813dc5851199acf3fe7f750052a0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b867a98/uploads/origins/ca1e9c1d-1f21-4b2f-93b7-e043cb98bd5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e997813dc5851199acf3fe7f750052a0, https://si.imgix.net/8b867a98/uploads/origins/ca1e9c1d-1f21-4b2f-93b7-e043cb98bd5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b1a5ec36120667b448bbebde1209c48 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b867a98/uploads/origins/ca1e9c1d-1f21-4b2f-93b7-e043cb98bd5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a1ca99e2dc9256b69c206ae711acadf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のOCブレアはかわいらしく、大きなハンバーガーを楽しんでいる。\nできれば校庭のベンチで横から。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1yQ6mMpTKdsH_uVv-5-oCKFZYhnqwE5W3/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8osakana_san8/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e896b164/uploads/origins/7c165151-c940-4dec-9d86-9e596335ec4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61e1867191f8c0c1bbd2a3c7b7e8d120", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e896b164/uploads/origins/7c165151-c940-4dec-9d86-9e596335ec4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61e1867191f8c0c1bbd2a3c7b7e8d120, https://si.imgix.net/e896b164/uploads/origins/7c165151-c940-4dec-9d86-9e596335ec4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae01f364f4016d992e2dbe35d1076313 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e896b164/uploads/origins/7c165151-c940-4dec-9d